 "notes": [
  "Rows 2026-11-20 (lane houthavens-memel-wiborg-20261120): the NW face runs straight along the BAG edge, so each LoD2.2 panel is one or more fronts: panel 23 (0-45.7 m from the NE corner, crop w02-320L 2022-12-14), 25 (52.7-69.0, w06-320), 283 (69.0-84.9, w07-320), 27 (84.9-96.0, w09-320), 35 (96.0-112.3, w05-320n 2022), 34+39 (112.3-122.7), 101 (123.1-133.9) and 36 (133.9-147.4) from w03-320 (2022-04-08). Panels 17/18 (45.7-52.6 m) and 41 are left to otherWalls. The SE side (w01-140 is 2019, under construction) is left to otherWalls in the red brick of its 2019 lower storeys.",
  "Not drawn (no kit part): the spout gables' stepped tops (the 3DBAG roof carries what it surveyed), the white vertical bays as one framed column (drawn as broad white surrounds on every window), the 'ANNO 2018' / 'STAD AMSTERDAM' / 'WIBORG' name stones, the arched ground portal."
 ],
